Loop is an omnichannel (online and physical) circular shopping platform that reuse all the packagings by offering delivery and pickup of products and empty packaging as a service. The company takes care of reverse logistics by cleaning, sanitation, reuse and redistribution. Brand partners of the Loop Platform, studied their products to ensure the maximum re-utilization to and the easy re-reliability of the containers. All packaging is secured by a deposit that incentivises return or creates a revenue stream if the packaging is not returned. Subscription and pick-up services create brand loyalty and provide information about user needs.